{"route":"/docs/4.5/content/typography/","version":"4.5","renderedVersion":"4.5","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Typography","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.5.3/site/docs/4.5/content/typography.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for Bootstrap typography, including global settings, headings, body text, lists, and more."},{"id":"global-settings","type":"heading","en":"Global settings","level":2},{"id":"global-settings--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap sets basic global display, typography, and link styles. When more control is needed, check out the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/utilities/text/\">textual utility classes</a>."},{"id":"global-settings--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"global-settings--item-1","type":"item","en":"Use a <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/reboot/#native-font-stack\">native font stack</a> that selects the best <code>font-family</code> for each OS and device."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"global-settings--item-2","type":"item","en":"For a more inclusive and accessible type scale, we assume the browser default root <code>font-size</code> (typically 16px) so visitors can customize their browser defaults as needed."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"global-settings--item-3","type":"item","en":"Use the <code>$font-family-base</code>, <code>$font-size-base</code>, and <code>$line-height-base</code> attributes as our typographic base applied to the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code>."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"global-settings--item-4","type":"item","en":"Set the global link color via <code>$link-color</code> and apply link underlines only on <code>:hover</code>."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"global-settings--item-5","type":"item","en":"Use <code>$body-bg</code> to set a <code>background-color</code> on the <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> (<code>#fff</code> by default)."}]}]},{"id":"global-settings--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"These styles can be found within <code>_reboot.scss</code>, and the global variables are defined in <code>_variables.scss</code>. Make sure to set <code>$font-size-base</code> in <code>rem</code>."},{"id":"headings","type":"heading","en":"Headings","level":2},{"id":"headings--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"All HTML headings, <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> through <code>&lt;h6&gt;</code>, are available."},{"id":"headings--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Heading"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Example"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"h1. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"h2. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"h3. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"h4. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h5&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"h5. Bootstrap heading"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>&lt;h6&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"headings--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"h6. Bootstrap heading"}]}]}]},{"id":"headings--code-1","type":"code","value":"<h1>h1. Bootstrap heading</h1>\n<h2>h2. Bootstrap heading</h2>\n<h3>h3. Bootstrap heading</h3>\n<h4>h4. Bootstrap heading</h4>\n<h5>h5. Bootstrap heading</h5>\n<h6>h6. Bootstrap heading</h6>","language":"html"},{"id":"headings--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.h1</code> through <code>.h6</code> classes are also available, for when you want to match the font styling of a heading but cannot use the associated HTML element."},{"id":"headings--example-1","type":"demo","key":"243a5ea22bcbaa760e0d","height":300},{"id":"headings--code-2","type":"code","value":"<p class=\"h1\">h1. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h2\">h2. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h3\">h3. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h4\">h4. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h5\">h5. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h6\">h6. Bootstrap heading</p>","language":"html"},{"id":"customizing-headings","type":"heading","en":"Customizing headings","level":3},{"id":"customizing-headings--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the included utility classes to recreate the small secondary heading text from Bootstrap 3."},{"id":"customizing-headings--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d9127d629a20923ffe23","height":147},{"id":"customizing-headings--code-1","type":"code","value":"<h3>\n  Fancy display heading\n  <small class=\"text-muted\">With faded secondary text</small>\n</h3>","language":"html"},{"id":"display-headings","type":"heading","en":"Display headings","level":2},{"id":"display-headings--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Traditional heading elements are designed to work best in the meat of your page content. When you need a heading to stand out, consider using a <strong>display heading</strong>—a larger, slightly more opinionated heading style. Keep in mind these headings are not responsive by default, but it’s possible to enable <a href=\"#responsive-font-sizes\">responsive font sizes</a>."},{"id":"display-headings--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0ecaa8e4ff544a485544","height":260},{"id":"display-headings--code-1","type":"code","value":"<h1 class=\"display-1\">Display 1</h1>\n<h1 class=\"display-2\">Display 2</h1>\n<h1 class=\"display-3\">Display 3</h1>\n<h1 class=\"display-4\">Display 4</h1>","language":"html"},{"id":"lead","type":"heading","en":"Lead","level":2},{"id":"lead--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Make a paragraph stand out by adding <code>.lead</code>."},{"id":"lead--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ae7ca1e01ddcf1b4f27b","height":147},{"id":"lead--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p class=\"lead\">\n  Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor auctor. Duis mollis, est non commodo luctus.\n</p>","language":"html"},{"id":"inline-text-elements","type":"heading","en":"Inline text elements","level":2},{"id":"inline-text-elements--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Styling for common inline HTML5 elements."},{"id":"inline-text-elements--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d17d05ae7e5e4efc69d8","height":300},{"id":"inline-text-elements--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p>You can use the mark tag to <mark>highlight</mark> text.</p>\n<p><del>This line of text is meant to be treated as deleted text.</del></p>\n<p><s>This line of text is meant to be treated as no longer accurate.</s></p>\n<p><ins>This line of text is meant to be treated as an addition to the document.</ins></p>\n<p><u>This line of text will render as underlined</u></p>\n<p><small>This line of text is meant to be treated as fine print.</small></p>\n<p><strong>This line rendered as bold text.</strong></p>\n<p><em>This line rendered as italicized text.</em></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"inline-text-elements--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.mark</code> and <code>.small</code> classes are also available to apply the same styles as <code>&lt;mark&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;small&gt;</code> while avoiding any unwanted semantic implications that the tags would bring."},{"id":"inline-text-elements--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"While not shown above, feel free to use <code>&lt;b&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;i&gt;</code> in HTML5. <code>&lt;b&gt;</code> is meant to highlight words or phrases without conveying additional importance while <code>&lt;i&gt;</code> is mostly for voice, technical terms, etc."},{"id":"text-utilities","type":"heading","en":"Text utilities","level":2},{"id":"text-utilities--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change text alignment, transform, style, weight, and color with our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/utilities/text/\">text utilities</a> and <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/utilities/colors/\">color utilities</a>."},{"id":"abbreviations","type":"heading","en":"Abbreviations","level":2},{"id":"abbreviations--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Stylized implementation of HTML’s <code>&lt;abbr&gt;</code> element for abbreviations and acronyms to show the expanded version on hover. Abbreviations have a default underline and gain a help cursor to provide additional context on hover and to users of assistive technologies."},{"id":"abbreviations--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.initialism</code> to an abbreviation for a slightly smaller font-size."},{"id":"abbreviations--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b1d9b690319293dfadbc","height":174},{"id":"abbreviations--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><abbr title=\"attribute\">attr</abbr></p>\n<p><abbr title=\"HyperText Markup Language\" class=\"initialism\">HTML</abbr></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"blockquotes","type":"heading","en":"Blockquotes","level":2},{"id":"blockquotes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"For quoting blocks of content from another source within your document. Wrap <code>&lt;blockquote class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;</code> around any <abbr title=\"HyperText Markup Language\">HTML</abbr> as the quote."},{"id":"blockquotes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"90740cb82587a34950e7","height":147},{"id":"blockquotes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n</blockquote>","language":"html"},{"id":"naming-a-source","type":"heading","en":"Naming a source","level":3},{"id":"naming-a-source--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add a <code>&lt;footer class=&quot;blockquote-footer&quot;&gt;</code> for identifying the source. Wrap the name of the source work in <code>&lt;cite&gt;</code>."},{"id":"naming-a-source--example-1","type":"demo","key":"19c0c6d1bf2e9c698193","height":147},{"id":"naming-a-source--code-1","type":"code","value":"<blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n  <footer class=\"blockquote-footer\">Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n</blockquote>","language":"html"},{"id":"alignment","type":"heading","en":"Alignment","level":3},{"id":"alignment--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use text utilities as needed to change the alignment of your blockquote."},{"id":"alignment--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ce5926e7cd0d2f9caae0","height":147},{"id":"alignment--code-1","type":"code","value":"<blockquote class=\"blockquote text-center\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n  <footer class=\"blockquote-footer\">Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n</blockquote>","language":"html"},{"id":"alignment--example-2","type":"demo","key":"81980455f53b1343c7a1","height":147},{"id":"alignment--code-2","type":"code","value":"<blockquote class=\"blockquote text-right\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n  <footer class=\"blockquote-footer\">Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n</blockquote>","language":"html"},{"id":"lists","type":"heading","en":"Lists","level":2},{"id":"unstyled","type":"heading","en":"Unstyled","level":3},{"id":"unstyled--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Remove the default <code>list-style</code> and left margin on list items (immediate children only). <strong>This only applies to immediate children list items</strong>, meaning you will need to add the class for any nested lists as well."},{"id":"unstyled--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c96c0aeea5d4c14f4393","height":147},{"id":"unstyled--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n  <li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</li>\n  <li>Consectetur adipiscing elit</li>\n  <li>Integer molestie lorem at massa</li>\n  <li>Facilisis in pretium nisl aliquet</li>\n  <li>Nulla volutpat aliquam velit\n    <ul>\n      <li>Phasellus iaculis neque</li>\n      <li>Purus sodales ultricies</li>\n      <li>Vestibulum laoreet porttitor sem</li>\n      <li>Ac tristique libero volutpat at</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n  <li>Faucibus porta lacus fringilla vel</li>\n  <li>Aenean sit amet erat nunc</li>\n  <li>Eget porttitor lorem</li>\n</ul>","language":"html"},{"id":"inline","type":"heading","en":"Inline","level":3},{"id":"inline--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Remove a list’s bullets and apply some light <code>margin</code> with a combination of two classes, <code>.list-inline</code> and <code>.list-inline-item</code>."},{"id":"inline--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7460011e1e3d59685170","height":147},{"id":"inline--code-1","type":"code","value":"<ul class=\"list-inline\">\n  <li class=\"list-inline-item\">Lorem ipsum</li>\n  <li class=\"list-inline-item\">Phasellus iaculis</li>\n  <li class=\"list-inline-item\">Nulla volutpat</li>\n</ul>","language":"html"},{"id":"description-list-alignment","type":"heading","en":"Description list alignment","level":3},{"id":"description-list-alignment--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Align terms and descriptions horizontally by using our grid system’s predefined classes (or semantic mixins). For longer terms, you can optionally add a <code>.text-truncate</code> class to truncate the text with an ellipsis."},{"id":"description-list-alignment--example-1","type":"demo","key":"01afd9bbccb7b129dd00","height":147},{"id":"description-list-alignment--code-1","type":"code","value":"<dl class=\"row\">\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Description lists</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">A description list is perfect for defining terms.</dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Euismod</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">\n    <p>Vestibulum id ligula porta felis euismod semper eget lacinia odio sem nec elit.</p>\n    <p>Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus.</p>\n  </dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Malesuada porta</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">Etiam porta sem malesuada magna mollis euismod.</dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3 text-truncate\">Truncated term is truncated</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">Fusce dapibus, tellus ac cursus commodo, tortor mauris condimentum nibh, ut fermentum massa justo sit amet risus.</dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Nesting</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">\n    <dl class=\"row\">\n      <dt class=\"col-sm-4\">Nested definition list</dt>\n      <dd class=\"col-sm-8\">Aenean posuere, tortor sed cursus feugiat, nunc augue blandit nunc.</dd>\n    </dl>\n  </dd>\n</dl>","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive-font-sizes","type":"heading","en":"Responsive font sizes","level":2},{"id":"responsive-font-sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"As of v4.3.0, Bootstrap ships with the option to enable responsive font sizes, allowing text to scale more naturally across device and viewport sizes. <abbr title=\"Responsive font sizes\">RFS</abbr> can be enabled by changing the <code>$enable-responsive-font-sizes</code> Sass variable to <code>true</code> and recompiling Bootstrap."},{"id":"responsive-font-sizes--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"To support <abbr title=\"Responsive font sizes\">RFS</abbr>, we use a Sass mixin to replace our normal <code>font-size</code> properties. Responsive font sizes will be compiled into <code>calc()</code> functions with a mix of <code>rem</code> and viewport units to enable the responsive scaling behavior. More about <abbr title=\"Responsive font sizes\">RFS</abbr> and its configuration can be found on its <a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/rfs/tree/v8.0.4\">GitHub repository</a>."}],"demos":[{"key":"243a5ea22bcbaa760e0d","html":"\n<p class=\"h1\">h1. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h2\">h2. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h3\">h3. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h4\">h4. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h5\">h5. Bootstrap heading</p>\n<p class=\"h6\">h6. Bootstrap heading</p>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d9127d629a20923ffe23","html":"\n<h3>\n  Fancy display heading\n  <small class=\"text-muted\">With faded secondary text</small>\n</h3>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"0ecaa8e4ff544a485544","html":"\n  <table class=\"table\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td><span class=\"display-1\">Display 1</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"display-2\">Display 2</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"display-3\">Display 3</span></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"display-4\">Display 4</span></td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-type"},"sprite":""},{"key":"ae7ca1e01ddcf1b4f27b","html":"\n<p class=\"lead\">\n  Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor auctor. Duis mollis, est non commodo luctus.\n</p>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d17d05ae7e5e4efc69d8","html":"\n<p>You can use the mark tag to <mark>highlight</mark> text.</p>\n<p><del>This line of text is meant to be treated as deleted text.</del></p>\n<p><s>This line of text is meant to be treated as no longer accurate.</s></p>\n<p><ins>This line of text is meant to be treated as an addition to the document.</ins></p>\n<p><u>This line of text will render as underlined</u></p>\n<p><small>This line of text is meant to be treated as fine print.</small></p>\n<p><strong>This line rendered as bold text.</strong></p>\n<p><em>This line rendered as italicized text.</em></p>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b1d9b690319293dfadbc","html":"\n<p><abbr title=\"attribute\">attr</abbr></p>\n<p><abbr title=\"HyperText Markup Language\" class=\"initialism\">HTML</abbr></p>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"90740cb82587a34950e7","html":"\n<blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n</blockquote>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"19c0c6d1bf2e9c698193","html":"\n<blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n  <footer class=\"blockquote-footer\">Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n</blockquote>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"ce5926e7cd0d2f9caae0","html":"\n<blockquote class=\"blockquote text-center\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n  <footer class=\"blockquote-footer\">Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n</blockquote>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"81980455f53b1343c7a1","html":"\n<blockquote class=\"blockquote text-right\">\n  <p class=\"mb-0\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer posuere erat a ante.</p>\n  <footer class=\"blockquote-footer\">Someone famous in <cite title=\"Source Title\">Source Title</cite></footer>\n</blockquote>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c96c0aeea5d4c14f4393","html":"\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n  <li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</li>\n  <li>Consectetur adipiscing elit</li>\n  <li>Integer molestie lorem at massa</li>\n  <li>Facilisis in pretium nisl aliquet</li>\n  <li>Nulla volutpat aliquam velit\n    <ul>\n      <li>Phasellus iaculis neque</li>\n      <li>Purus sodales ultricies</li>\n      <li>Vestibulum laoreet porttitor sem</li>\n      <li>Ac tristique libero volutpat at</li>\n    </ul>\n  </li>\n  <li>Faucibus porta lacus fringilla vel</li>\n  <li>Aenean sit amet erat nunc</li>\n  <li>Eget porttitor lorem</li>\n</ul>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7460011e1e3d59685170","html":"\n<ul class=\"list-inline\">\n  <li class=\"list-inline-item\">Lorem ipsum</li>\n  <li class=\"list-inline-item\">Phasellus iaculis</li>\n  <li class=\"list-inline-item\">Nulla volutpat</li>\n</ul>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"01afd9bbccb7b129dd00","html":"\n<dl class=\"row\">\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Description lists</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">A description list is perfect for defining terms.</dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Euismod</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">\n    <p>Vestibulum id ligula porta felis euismod semper eget lacinia odio sem nec elit.</p>\n    <p>Donec id elit non mi porta gravida at eget metus.</p>\n  </dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Malesuada porta</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">Etiam porta sem malesuada magna mollis euismod.</dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3 text-truncate\">Truncated term is truncated</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">Fusce dapibus, tellus ac cursus commodo, tortor mauris condimentum nibh, ut fermentum massa justo sit amet risus.</dd>\n\n  <dt class=\"col-sm-3\">Nesting</dt>\n  <dd class=\"col-sm-9\">\n    <dl class=\"row\">\n      <dt class=\"col-sm-4\">Nested definition list</dt>\n      <dd class=\"col-sm-8\">Aenean posuere, tortor sed cursus feugiat, nunc augue blandit nunc.</dd>\n    </dl>\n  </dd>\n</dl>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Utilities for layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/utilities-for-layout/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Reboot","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Typography","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/typography/"},{"en":"Code","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/code/"},{"en":"Images","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/images/"},{"en":"Tables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/tables/"},{"en":"Figures","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/content/figures/"},{"en":"Components","href